{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, אֲכַל","hw":"אֲכַל","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אֲכַל</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. eat, devour (</strong>BH<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Pf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲכַ֫לוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:8\" href=\"/Daniel.3.8\">Dn 3:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:25\" href=\"/Daniel.6.25\">6:25</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵאכֻל</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:30\" href=\"/Daniel.4.30\">4:30</a>; 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תֵּאכֻל</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:23\" href=\"/Daniel.7.23\">7:23</a>; Imv. fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲכֻ֫לִי</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:5\" href=\"/Daniel.7.5\">5</a>; Pt. fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">אָֽכְלָה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:7\" href=\"/Daniel.7.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:19\" href=\"/Daniel.7.19\">19</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>eat</em>, of beast, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:30\" href=\"/Daniel.4.30\">Dn 4:30</a> (acc. rei). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>devour</em>, of beast in vision, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:5\" href=\"/Daniel.7.5\">7:5</a> (acc. rei), abs. v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:7\" href=\"/Daniel.7.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:19\" href=\"/Daniel.7.19\">19</a>; hence fig. of kingdom, <em>devour, devastate</em>, v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:23\" href=\"/Daniel.7.23\">23</a> (acc. of earth). <strong>3.</strong>  in phr. <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ קַרְצֵיהוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:8\" href=\"/Daniel.3.8\">3:8</a> <em>eat their pieces</em>, i.e. slander them, cf.<a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:25\" href=\"/Daniel.6.25\">6:25</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, קְרַץ\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_קְרַץ\", dir=\"rtl\">קְרַץ</a>).","next":"BDB Aramaic, אַל","prev":"BDB Aramaic, אִיתַי"}